stem:
A retail company wants to use Amazon Bedrock Agents to build an intelligent return assistant. When a customer enters an order number to request a return, the Agent needs to perform these steps:
1. Query DynamoDB to check the order date;
2. Calculate whether the 14-day return period has been exceeded;
3. If not exceeded, call the logistics API to generate a return label.
How does the Bedrock Agent execute the API actions in steps 1 and 3?
